Package: SexSeek
Title: Estimate Genetic Sex from Expression Counts
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Saket", "Choudhary", email = "saketc@iitb.ac.in", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5202-7633"))
Description: Calls genetic sex from bulk or single-cell expression counts using
    sex-chromosome gene expression and X-inactivation markers. Works on a counts
    matrix directly. 
